			<div class="entry-content" itemprop="text">
			<div class="entry-list-taxonomies"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/category/consulting/" rel="tag">Consulting</a><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/renewable-energy/" rel="tag">Renewable energy</a><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/industry/" rel="tag">Industry</a><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/market-uptake/" rel="tag">Market uptake</a><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/tag/go-to-market-strategy-and-commercialization-for-green-hydrogen-and-electrolyzer-manufacturers-b2b-and-b2g-channel-development/" rel="tag">Go-to-market strategy and commercialization for green hydrogen and electrolyzer manufacturers; B2B and B2G channel development</a></div><div class="speaker-data main-focus"><label>Short description</label><span class="value"><p>Commercial Strategy | Frontier Tech GTM</p></span></div><div class="speaker-data quote"><label>Quote </label><span class="value"><p>I've spent years in rooms where I was one of or the only woman. This network exists so hopefully the next generation doesn't have to get used to that.</p></span></div><div class="speaker-data company"><label>Company / Position </label><span class="value">Advisor | Couet Strategic Advisors & CMO | HYDGEN</span></div><div class="speaker-data industry"><label>Sector</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/category/consulting/" rel="tag">Consulting</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data country"><label>Based in</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/country/canada/" rel="tag">Canada</a>Québec</span></div><div class="speaker-data language"><label>Languages</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/language/english/" rel="tag">English</a>, <a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/language/french/" rel="tag">French</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data bio"><label>Short Bio </label><span class="value"><p>Nathalie Couët is the founder of Couët Strategic Advisors Inc., a boutique commercial strategy firm specializing in go-to-market architecture and commercialization strategy for frontier technology companies. She works primarily with seed to Series A ventures in climate tech, deep tech, dual-use, and critical infrastructure sectors navigating complex B2B and B2G markets.</p><p></p><p>With 16+ years of experience across SaaS, hardware, publishing, and finance — and an academic background in bioanthropology and archaeogenetics — Nathalie brings an unusual combination of analytical rigour and commercial instinct to some of the most technically complex markets in the energy transition.</p><p></p><p>Her active client roster includes HYDGEN, an electrolyzer commercialization company targeting APAC markets, where she leads channel partner strategy across four commercial verticals. She is embedded as a senior commercial partner rather than a traditional external consultant, building multi-year relationships with the companies she advises.</p></span></div><div class="speaker-data focus-topic"><label>Focus Topics</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/renewable-energy/" rel="tag">Renewable energy</a>, <a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/industry/" rel="tag">Industry</a>, <a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/focus-topic/market-uptake/" rel="tag">Market uptake</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data other-expertise"><label>Other Expertise</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/tag/go-to-market-strategy-and-commercialization-for-green-hydrogen-and-electrolyzer-manufacturers-b2b-and-b2g-channel-development/" rel="tag">Go-to-market strategy and commercialization for green hydrogen and electrolyzer manufacturers; B2B and B2G channel development</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data speakerlevel"><label>Speaker level</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/speakerlevel/initial-speaker-experience/" rel="tag">Initial speaker experience</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data joblevel"><label>Job level</label><span class="value"><a href="https://women-in-green-hydrogen.net/joblevel/c-level/" rel="tag">C-level (top-level management)</a></span></div><div class="speaker-data conferences"><label>Selected conferences, presentations and speeches</label><span class="value"><p>Web Summit 2025 | Spring Impact Capital (Impact Measurement &amp; KPIs) | ACET (Commercializing Quantum Tech)</p></span></div>			
			
			
